{"3974570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scuff Slayer", "steam_appid": 3974570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/0c0dbf40a52427eb530f25b2899b026e.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>PLAY AS THE LEGEND</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the <strong>Scuff Slayer</strong>, a young soldier trapped in an agonizing loop of pain. Experience the frenetic mix of a Survivors-like / Bullet Heaven with the dense storyline of a Visual Novel. Here, <strong>THERE ARE NO RESTRICTIONS</strong>, your only goal is to <strong>KILL THEM ALL</strong> using a completely insane arsenal containing over 400 abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Used flip-flops? YOU CAN!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Briefcases of money? YOU CAN!</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Demonic trees? YOU CAN!</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Abstract programming concepts? YOU CAN!</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unbelievable threats like a <strong>giant Vulture</strong>, a <strong>Bee in a suit</strong>, or even a <strong>DEMONIC MOTORCYCLE</strong>! Everything in the world can be your enemy... or your next weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/199e1cbeb77af5b7a11ac568cbbaafa0.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>DISCOVER THE SIMPLIFICATION</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive headfirst into a mystery that changed the face of the Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the unknown process that attacked humanity and gave rise to the <strong>&quot;Scuffs&quot;</strong>: bizarre creatures that reflect the human form in the simplest and most grotesque way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/90523807ef7caf7831dc1a827106b17c.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>FIGHT THE SIMPLIFIER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the entity that turned reality upside down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and destroy the <u><strong>False God</strong></u> that threw this world into chaos, freeing humanity from systemic ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/e6dd47eddfdaaca3ff2ccebd861a5cdf.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>DISCOVER THE BINARY BREATHING</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to manipulate the world's data. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <u><strong>&quot;Binary Breathing&quot;</strong></u>, an ancient art that allows users to utilize actual programming logic to <u><strong>gain power and transcend reality.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>INHALE == TRUE;</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>EXHALE == F</strong></u><strong>ALSE;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><u><i><strong>THERE IS NO THIRD STATE;</strong></i></u></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/776297c693066a808a274a1f13c849ea.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>FACE THE INEVITABLE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you use logic to your advantage and destroy armies of demons, remember: <strong>ALL STORIES NEED AN END</strong>. At the end of the line, humanity's greatest challenge awaits you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEATH.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can run, you can hide... but it <u><strong>WILL</strong></u><strong> ALWAYS</strong> find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/0c0dbf40a52427eb530f25b2899b026e.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>PLAY AS THE LEGEND</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the <strong>Scuff Slayer</strong>, a young soldier trapped in an agonizing loop of pain. Experience the frenetic mix of a Survivors-like / Bullet Heaven with the dense storyline of a Visual Novel. Here, <strong>THERE ARE NO RESTRICTIONS</strong>, your only goal is to <strong>KILL THEM ALL</strong> using a completely insane arsenal containing over 400 abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Used flip-flops? YOU CAN!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Briefcases of money? YOU CAN!</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Demonic trees? YOU CAN!</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Abstract programming concepts? YOU CAN!</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unbelievable threats like a <strong>giant Vulture</strong>, a <strong>Bee in a suit</strong>, or even a <strong>DEMONIC MOTORCYCLE</strong>! Everything in the world can be your enemy... or your next weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/199e1cbeb77af5b7a11ac568cbbaafa0.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>DISCOVER THE SIMPLIFICATION</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive headfirst into a mystery that changed the face of the Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the unknown process that attacked humanity and gave rise to the <strong>&quot;Scuffs&quot;</strong>: bizarre creatures that reflect the human form in the simplest and most grotesque way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/90523807ef7caf7831dc1a827106b17c.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>FIGHT THE SIMPLIFIER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the entity that turned reality upside down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and destroy the <u><strong>False God</strong></u> that threw this world into chaos, freeing humanity from systemic ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/e6dd47eddfdaaca3ff2ccebd861a5cdf.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>DISCOVER THE BINARY BREATHING</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to manipulate the world's data. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <u><strong>&quot;Binary Breathing&quot;</strong></u>, an ancient art that allows users to utilize actual programming logic to <u><strong>gain power and transcend reality.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>INHALE == TRUE;</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>EXHALE == F</strong></u><strong>ALSE;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><u><i><strong>THERE IS NO THIRD STATE;</strong></i></u></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/776297c693066a808a274a1f13c849ea.avif?t=1779858146\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>FACE THE INEVITABLE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you use logic to your advantage and destroy armies of demons, remember: <strong>ALL STORIES NEED AN END</strong>. At the end of the line, humanity's greatest challenge awaits you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEATH.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can run, you can hide... but it <u><strong>WILL</strong></u><strong> ALWAYS</strong> find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Become the Scuff Slayer. The legend who will save the world from simplification! In this top-down 2D pixel art game, programming concepts are woven into the story.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.ste